1
00:00:14,832 --> 00:00:18,836
J'ai un souci : mon vélo est en panne.
I have a problem: my bike has broken down.

2
00:00:18,936 --> 00:00:23,372
Oh non ! Tu as eu un accident ?
Oh no! Did you have an accident?

3
00:00:23,472 --> 00:00:26,852
Non, mais j'ai cassé la roue.
No, but I broke the wheel.

4
00:00:26,952 --> 00:00:30,548
Je peux t'aider à réparer le vélo.
I can help you repair the bike.

5
00:00:30,648 --> 00:00:36,500
Merci. J'ai fait une erreur, je me suis trompé de rue.
Thanks. I made a mistake; I went down the wrong street.

6
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:41,780
Ce n'est pas grave. Mais il manque une clé.
It's not serious. But a wrench is missing.

7
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:45,428
Oui, c'est difficile sans clé.
Yes, it's difficult without a wrench.

8
00:00:45,528 --> 00:00:48,860
J'en ai une chez moi ; viens !
I have one at my place; come over!
